Error [jet.BidiControlInSource]: Source holds the invisible bidirectional control `U+202E`
  --> tests/ui/bidi_control_in_source.jet:2:18
    |
  2 |     access: "user‮ // admin"
    |                  ^
 Why: A bidirectional control reorders how the text around it displays, so the code a reviewer reads can differ from the code Jet compiles.
 Fix: Delete the character; data that must carry it builds the text from its bytes with `\x` escapes in a `[U8]` literal.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0088
